feat(dispatch): HTTP routes for /dispatches over the queue

Six endpoints mirroring the CLI surface: POST /dispatches (propose), GET /dispatches (list with state/requestedBy/limit filters), GET /:id (single), POST /:id/accept, POST /:id/reject (requires reason >=3 chars), POST /:id/cancel. Registered conditionally on deps.dispatchQueue being supplied, so the daemon doesn't 500 if the dispatch system isn't fully wired yet. Operator-direct surface only; runner+harbormaster internal transitions stay direct-DB.


